618	681	617	617	Thomas	11	' library . My education was neglected , yet I was passionately fond of reading . These volumes were my study day and night , and my familiarity with them increased that regret which I had felt , as a child , on learning that my father 's dying injunction had forbidden my uncle to allow me to embark in a seafaring life .
